g}_{8}⁡x$ is $x\\in (0,\\infty )$ and the range is $y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $x>0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-83ddd1a9-0fe9-5c63-8c81-7a18c730d0ad"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-83ddd1a9-0fe9-5c63-8c81-7a18c730d0ad" :answer-field/id #uuid "83ddd1a9-0fe9-5c63-8c81-7a18c730d0ad" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-92382c27-92bc-5dd2-b684-531a54f35ad5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-92382c27-92bc-5dd2-b684-531a54f35ad5" "answer-bddb2057-4188-5174-9bc9-88b940ddc770" "answer-ecd4ae46-c2af-5662-9274-af388364381f" "answer-c535ba02-2a79-572c-ab29-8e7e3c7aa7f1" "answer-bbc46073-1800-5e01-bd0a-db637fa7e045"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92382c27-92bc-5dd2-b684-531a54f35ad5" :answer/id #uuid "92382c27-92bc-5dd2-b684-531a54f35ad5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bddb2057-4188-5174-9bc9-88b940ddc770" :answer/id #uuid "bddb2057-4188-5174-9bc9-88b940ddc770" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ecd4ae46-c2af-5662-9274-af388364381f" :answer/id #uuid "ecd4ae46-c2af-5662-9274-af388364381f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge 0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c535ba02-2a79-572c-ab29-8e7e3c7aa7f1" :answer/id #uuid "c535ba02-2a79-572c-ab29-8e7e3c7aa7f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ne 8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bbc46073-1800-5e01-bd0a-db637fa7e045" :answer/id #uuid "bbc46073-1800-5e01-bd0a-db637fa7e045" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "All real numbers" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186234082 :question/problem "What's the range of $f(x)={log}_{9}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the graph of $y={log}_{9}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/40/40664f8